        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WL07, Small Window Sash Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana is an architectural hardware manufacturer famous for solid brass hardware with a proven record for exceptional quality. This Solid Brass Small Window Sash Lock is common on northern home windows. The thumb handle allows you to rotate the catch and get a tight lock and seal. Not only does it improve security, but a good sealing window can help lower energy costs. Replace your old worn and painted over window locks with new solid brass ones. Easy to install with included matching finish screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WL07-Specifications.gif?v=1704354677\" width=\"580\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WL07 Small Window Sash Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-large-window-sash-lock-deltana-wls9\"><b>Large Window Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WL07 Small Window Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Height (total including strike): 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Spacing: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Small Window Sash Lock | Deltana WL07",
                "description": "Small Window Sash Lock Deltana WL07 - Deltana is an architectural hardware manufacturer famous for solid brass hardware with a proven record for exceptional quality. This Solid Brass Small Window Sash Lock is common on northern home windows. The thumb handle allows you to rotate the catch and get a tight lock and seal. Not only does it improve security, but a good sealing window can help lower energy costs. Replace your old worn and painted over window locks with new solid brass ones. Easy to install with included matching finish screws.",
